---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy | Taxzentic';
const description = 'Privacy Policy for Taxzentic — how we handle data across our client-side calculators, file tools, and AI-assisted drafting features.';
const lastUpdated = '16 September 2026';
---

<BaseLayout {title} {description}>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="mb-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-base mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-neutral dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base mb-3">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>
          Welcome to <strong>Taxzentic</strong> ("we", "our", or "us"). We are committed to transparency and protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains our data practices when you visit taxzentic.com and use our compliance calculators, file utilities, and AI legal drafting tools.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base mb-3">2. Information We Collect &amp; How It Is Processed</h2>
        
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-base mb-2">2.1 Client-Side Tools &amp; Calculators (100% Local Processing)</h3>
        <p>
          The vast majority of utilities on Taxzentic—including our GST Calculator, HSN Code Lookup, GSTIN Validator, E-Way Bill Validity Calculator, Pin-to-Pin Distance Estimator, MSME Delayed Payment Calculator, and Excel file tools—operate entirely within your client-side web browser. <strong>No financial figures, invoice amounts, party names, or uploaded files are transmitted to our servers or stored by us.</strong> All computations and JSON/Excel parsing occur locally on your device.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-base mb-2 mt-4">2.2 AI-Assisted Features (GST Notice Reply Generator)</h3>
        <p>
          For features explicitly designated as AI-powered—such as the <em>GST Notice Reply Generator</em>—the specific parameters you enter (notice type, section, demand amounts, dispute grounds, and optional context) are transmitted via encrypted HTTPS to our Cloudflare Pages serverless backend function and forwarded to our AI inference partner (Groq) solely to draft the requested legal response.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm">
          <li><strong>Ephemeral Processing:</strong> Your inputs are held in temporary server memory only for the seconds required to stream the generated reply back to your screen.</li>
          <li><strong>Zero Storage &amp; Zero Training:</strong> We do not log, persist, or store your taxpayer data in databases. Data transmitted to the AI provider is never used to train machine learning models.</li>
          <li><strong>Client-Side Alternative:</strong> A 100% local, offline template generator ("Update Template") is always provided side-by-side if you prefer not to transmit text to an AI model.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-base mb-2 mt-4">2.3 Automatically Collected Infrastructure Data</h3>
        <p>
          When you visit our website, standard non-identifying telemetry may be collected through reputable infrastructure partners:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm">
          <li><strong>Google Analytics 4:</strong> We use GA4 to understand aggregate page visits and referral channels. Data is anonymized (IP masking enabled) and governed by Google's Privacy Policy. You can opt out using the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent hover:underline">Google Analytics Opt-out Add-on</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Cloudflare:</strong> Our site is served through Cloudflare Pages for DDoS defense, edge caching, and security logging.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base mb-3">3. Cookies &amp; Local Storage</h2>
        <p>
          We use a single local key (<code>theme</code>) stored in your browser's <code>localStorage</code> solely to remember your dark or light mode interface preference. We do not use tracking or advertising cookies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base mb-3">4. How We Use Information</h2>
        <p>Information processed by our website is used strictly to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm">
          <li>Deliver the calculated results or legal drafts you explicitly request</li>
          <li>Protect against automated denial-of-service or API rate limit abuse</li>
          <li>Maintain site stability and monitor aggregated performance</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">We do <strong>not</strong> sell, monetize, rent, or trade your personal or financial data to any third party.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base mb-3">5. Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>
          Our guides link to authoritative government portals (e.g., cbic.gov.in, gst.gov.in, ewaybillgst.gov.in, rbi.org.in). We are not responsible for the privacy practices of external websites.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base mb-3">6. Data Security &amp; Privacy-First Design</h2>
        <p>
          We adopt a privacy-by-design architecture: computation is pushed to your device wherever technically feasible, avoiding unnecessary server transmission. Where serverless AI drafting is invoked, all transmissions are secured via end-to-end TLS 1.3 encryption.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base mb-3">7. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Our website is not directed at children under 13 years of age. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base mb-3">8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date. Continued use of the website after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base mb-3">9. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please <a href="/contact" class="text-accent hover:underline">contact us</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
